Dialogue: 7,0:02:14.20,0:02:22.62,OP - CN - 1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur10}对不起  让人如此地思念
Dialogue: 7,0:02:22.62,0:02:26.42,OP - CN - 1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur10}究竟是谁的错呢
Dialogue: 7,0:02:26.42,0:02:34.84,OP - CN - 1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur10}无所谓  让人如此地寂寞
Dialogue: 7,0:02:34.84,0:02:38.68,OP - CN - 1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur10}干脆就让它消失吧
Dialogue: 7,0:02:40.09,0:02:41.88,OP - CN - 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur10\fn方正兰亭圆_GBK_中}Sunday  morning
Dialogue: 7,0:02:41.88,0:02:46.31,OP - CN - 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur10}我比谁都更加爱着你
Dialogue: 7,0:02:46.31,0:02:51.78,OP - CN - 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur10}就连悲伤都可以跨越
Dialogue: 7,0:02:52.36,0:02:54.17,OP - CN - 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}{\blur10\fn方正兰亭圆_GBK_中\3c&HF0BF3C&}Sunday  morning
Dialogue: 6,0:02:54.17,0:02:55.58,OP - CN - 2,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\3c&HEFA5AA&}无论何时  比谁都想要抱紧你
Dialogue: 6,0:02:55.58,0:02:57.07,OP - CN - 2,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\3c&H8184F5&}无论何时  比谁都想要抱紧你
Dialogue: 6,0:02:57.07,0:02:58.41,OP - CN - 2,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\3c&H4DD5B0&}无论何时  比谁都想要抱紧你
Dialogue: 7,0:02:58.41,0:03:00.81,OP - CN - 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur10}我逐渐地坠入
Dialogue: 7,0:03:00.81,0:03:04.70,OP - CN - 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur10}无法自救的爱河
Dialogue: 7,0:03:04.70,0:03:07.72,OP - CN - 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur10}{\t(0,600,\bord8\c&H080303&\3c&H40E8FC&)}虽然可能有点啰嗦  但我已经爱上你了
Dialogue: 7,0:03:07.72,0:03:10.77,OP - CN - 3,,0,0,13,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur10}我犯了爱上你的罪  想和你一起生活下去
